<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Votre billet — {{ ticket.ticketNumber }}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .wrapper {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #CD935B;
            padding: 32px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .header p {
            margin: 6px 0 0;
            color: #fbeee2;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .header-logo {
            display: block;
            max-width: 210px;
            width: 55%;
            height: auto;
            margin: 0 auto 14px;
        }
        .body {
            padding: 36px 40px;
        }
        .salutation {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .intro {
            color: #555555;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .receipt-box {
            background-color: #fdfbf6;
            border-left: 4px solid #CD935B;
            border: 1px solid #eadcc7;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .receipt-box h2 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #804423;
        }
        .receipt-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }
        .receipt-table td {
            padding: 6px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .receipt-table td:first-child {
            color: #777777;
            width: 45%;
        }
        .receipt-table td:last-child {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #804423;
        }
        .ticket-number {
            font-size: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #804423;
        }
        .cta {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 28px 0;
        }
        .cta a {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #CD935B;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .note {
            background-color: #fffbf0;
            border: 1px solid #f0d060;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #555555;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">

    <div class="header">
        {% if hasLogo %}<img src="cid:logo" class="header-logo" alt="CCAPAC">{% endif %}
        <h1>Votre billet est prêt</h1>
        <p>Cinémathèque — Ciné-Dimanche</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">

        <p class="salutation">Bonjour <strong>{{ registration.fullName }}</strong>,</p>

        <p class="intro">
            Votre inscription à la séance <strong>{{ ticket.screening.film.title ?? 'Séance' }}</strong>
            est confirmée. Votre billet numérique est joint à ce message au format PDF.
        </p>

        <div class="receipt-box">
            <h2>Votre billet</h2>
            <table class="receipt-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Numéro</td>
                    <td class="ticket-number">{{ ticket.ticketNumber }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Date</td>
                    <td>{{ ticket.screening.scheduledDate ? ticket.screening.scheduledDate|date('d/m/Y') : '—' }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Heure</td>
                    <td>{{ ticket.screening.startTime ? ticket.screening.startTime|date('H:i') : '—' }}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Lieu</td>
                    <td>{{ ticket.screening.venue ?? '—' }}</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="cta">
            <a href="{{ viewUrl }}">Voir mon billet en ligne</a>
        </div>

        <div class="note">
            Présentez ce billet (imprimé ou sur votre smartphone) à l'entrée de la séance.
            Il est strictement personnel et non transférable.
        </div>

        <p style="margin-top: 28px; color: #333333;">
            À bientôt,<br>
            <strong>L'équipe du Grand Tambour</strong>
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>
            Biblio-Librairie du Grand Tambour · Centre Culturel · Kinshasa, RDC<br>
            <a href="mailto:munongo.bonkey@centreculturel.cd" style="color:#804423;">munongo.bonkey@centreculturel.cd</a>
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 11px;">
            Ce message a été envoyé automatiquement suite à votre inscription (billet {{ ticket.ticketNumber }}).
        </p>
    </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
